{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45060","headline":"奉和陆使君长源夏月游太湖 · 皎然","name":"奉和陆使君长源夏月游太湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庾公心旷远，府事局耳目。\n遂与南湖游，虚襟涤烦燠。\n始知皇天意，积水在亭育。\n细流信不让，动物欣所蓄。\n万顷合天容，洗然无云族。\n峭蒨瞩仙岭，超遥随明牧。\n知公爱澄清，波静气亦肃。\n已见横流极，况闻长鲸戮。\n中洲暂采苹，南郡思剖竹。\n向夕分好风，飘然送归舳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}